reak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nどうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はものすごく\n楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/29/5179942/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当にありがとうございました(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルはパフォーマンスしてなんぼでしょ！まじで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、本当に楽しかった(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからのアンダーライブに\n来てくださるみなさんは楽しみにしててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/29/5179942/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の\nアンダーライブで\nパフォーマンス初披露させてもらった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thアンダー曲『ここにいる理由』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/29/5179942/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の衣装。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしこの写メ\nあんまり衣装が見えない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！そう思ったそこのあなた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、乃木どこで\n『ここにいる理由』が流れますので\nそこで見ましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06